0 FILE 31070 - main.ldr
0 A three-in-one LEGO Creator car model with a blue-and-white off-road vehicle theme, featuring a detailed chassis, opening doors, front and rear windows, a rear spoiler, hatch, and four wheels.
0 Name: 31070 - main.ldr
0 Author: Stefan Frenz [smf]
